ctr_bishop_sac_queen_fork.gof
rook_o .hanging
bishop_t *Captures pawn_o *becomes bishop2
pawn2_t *Captures bishop2 *becomes pawn3
queen_t *Captures pawn3 *becomes queen2
        .Forks king .and rook

ctn_double_hanging_queen_rook_ex.gof
rook_t *Captures knight_o *becomes rook2
rook3_t *Captures rook2 *becomes rook4
                                    .hanging
queen_t *Captures rook4 *becomes queen2                                    

bm_queen_lure_via_bishop_check.gof
bishop_t *Checks king_o *becomes bishop2
king *EvadesTo sq *becomes king2
rook_o .hanging
queen_t *Captures rook *becomes queen2
        .Checks king2

ctr_double_hanging_queen_rook_ex.gof
rook_t *Captures rook2_o *becomes rook3
       .Checks king
rook4_t *Captures rook3 *becomes rook5
                                    .hanging
queen_t *Captures rook5 *becomes queen2                                    
        .Checks king

ctr_hanging_queen_fork.gof
rook_o .hanging
queen_t *Forks king_o *and rook *becomes queen2
king *EvadesTo sq *becomes king2
queen2 *Captures rook *becomes queen3

ctn_hanging_defend_knight.gof
knight_o .hanging
king_t *Captures knight *becomes king2
pawn_o .hanging
king3_t *Checks pawn *becomes king4
                                .notAttacked
knight2_t *Defends pawn *becomes knight3
                                     .onlyDefendedBy king2